# SYNTHETIC. Written from RFC 5321 and RFC 1870. Not a recording:
# phase-0 capture against a real server has not happened yet.
# SIZE 10 is below this message, so the client refuses before AUTH.

S: 220 smtp.example ESMTP ready
C: EHLO client.example
S: 250-smtp.example Hello
S: 250-SIZE 10
S: 250 AUTH PLAIN
FAIL Refused
